{
  "layer": "solution",
  "type": "container",
  "name": "frontend-process",
  "body": "The per-language scanner frontends (Go src/golib, Java src/javalib, C++ src/cpplib, Rust src/rustlib, TS src/tslib, C# src/csharplib, Python src/pylib — a planned addition, Markdown src/mdlib staged as the `mdfrontend` Rust binary — a planned addition). They must accept a target set, resolve against the full compilation context (for Python, the full `ty` project), emit only the target, and use their native incremental/artifact cache (for Python, the ty/salsa engine).",
